   "codigo": "qM(p)=(q0*NqD(p)*(1+0.1*KpD(p)*bl)*(1+0.1*db*sqrt(KpD(p)))+bef/2*gs*(NqD(p)-1)*tan(1.4*p*pi/180)*(1+0.1*KpD(p)*bl)*(1+0.1*db*sqrt(KpD(p))))/FSn",
   "modo": 0
